Sam (CSM): Quick thread for Meridian onboarding. They rolled a SPA with several widgets and hit bursts of 429s during initial ramp. Renewal review next week so want stability.

Diego (Support Eng): Can you paste the small log snippet they sent? 429s on init typically point at ephemeral token prefetch or many init calls.

Sam (CSM): Log they pasted:```
2026-04-10T09:22:14Z WARN rate_limiter preflight deny tenant=meridian count=142 window=1s
2026-04-10T09:22:14Z ERROR http 429 preflight_tokens_exhausted
```

Faye (DevEx): 142/sec at init strongly suggests parallel token fetches. Do they call SDK.init() in multiple components or iframes?

Sam (CSM): Yes, multiple widgets + an analytics iframe each do their own init on mount.

Harper (Solutions Eng): Immediate customer-facing mitigations: 1) Turn off client auto-prefetch and fetch one token per session on your backend, pass it to widgets. 2) If you must init in many places, add a randomized splay (300-1500ms) before calling init. 3) Implement a short client retry for 429s with exponential backoff so UX isn't broken.

Diego (Support Eng): Example retry/splay we gave them:```js
// splay before init + retry on 429
setTimeout(()=>safeInit(), Math.random()*1200 + 300);
let tries=0;
function safeInit(){
  tries++;
  sdk.init().catch(err=>{
    if(err.status===429 && tries<5){
      const backoff = Math.min(2000, 100*Math.pow(2,tries)) + Math.random()*200;
      setTimeout(safeInit, backoff);
    }
  });
}
```

Sam (CSM): They asked if we can provide a temporary server-side relief while they roll the client change. Renewal pressure so requested ASAP.

Harper (Solutions Eng): We can approve a 3x tenant preflight bump for a short window if ops agrees. Prefer app change + retry as permanent fix.

ops-bot: CR-8342 opened: preflight quota increase tenant=meridian 142->426/s for 2026-04-10T10:00:00Z to 2026-04-10T13:00:00Z. Notifying #eng-oncall.

Faye (DevEx): I'll add a one-paragraph note to our onboarding checklist: "If you use multiple widgets/iframes, centralize token issuance or use postMessage sharing; enable splay on init; implement graceful 429 retry." Also filed DX-1350 to add an SDK init splay option.

Sam (CSM): I'll update Meridian and ask them to validate by 12:30 UTC. Please keep CR-8342 open until they confirm. I'll post results here. :thumbsup:
